Comment:
 This package contains no third-party speed-test engine.
 .
 The official Ookla Speedtest CLI is proprietary software licensed by Ookla
 under its own End User Licence Agreement, which does not permit
 redistribution by third parties. It is therefore neither bundled in this
 package nor declared as a dependency. When it is already installed the
 application uses it; when it is not, the application explains that it is
 Ookla's software and offers to guide the user through installing it from
 Ookla's own software source.
 .
 The fallback engine, speedtest-cli, is Apache-2.0 licensed and is packaged
 separately in Ubuntu. It is declared as an ordinary dependency and is not
 included in this package either.
 .
 See docs/DEPENDENCIES.md for the full third-party dependency and licence
 list.
